# Core engine pipeline

Entry: `CoreEngineFactory` → `DetectionPipeline`.

```
SpeechSegment → FeatureExtractor → PatternDetector → StageTransitionDetector
                                      ↓ (FSM llmTrigger)
                         TriggeredScenarioModel → RiskAggregator → RiskStateMachine
                                      → DetectionEvent (null if SAFE and no stage transition)
```

## Package map (`com.scamdefender.core`)

| Package | Responsibility |
|---------|----------------|
| `pipeline` | `DetectionPipeline` orchestration, 60s transcript window |
| `features` | Keyword/heuristic `FeatureVector` (urgency, authority, …) |
| `patterns` | Aho-Corasick + ONNX MiniLM semantic matcher + `PatternFsm` |
| `stages` | Temporal stage distribution / transitions |
| `llm` | `ScenarioModel`; JVM uses `HeuristicScenarioModel` (MediaPipe/Gemma planned on Android) |
| `risk` | Score aggregation + momentum-gated state machine |
| `scenarios` | Load ontology / patterns bank JSON |
| `stt` | `SherpaSttEngine` / `MockSttEngine` / `TranscriptParser` |
| `audio` | Silero VAD, segmenter, WAV reader |
| `ml` | `ModelPaths`, ONNX runtime holder |
| `eval` | `EvalFramework` for manifest-driven cases |
| `domain` | Serializable DTOs / enums |

## Pattern detection

- Keywords: Aho-Corasick over `patterns_bank.json` phrases
- Semantics: MiniLM ONNX embeddings; falls back if models missing
- Merge by `DetectedPatternType`, keep highest confidence
- FSM sequence can set `llmTrigger` → scenario model runs sparingly

## Wiring notes

- `CoreEngineFactory.create()` wires real VAD/STT/ONNX with fallbacks
- `forTranscript(segments)` swaps in `MockSttEngine` for demo/eval
- Prefer extending ontology JSON / matchers over hardcoding new RU phrases in Kotlin when possible
- Scenario IDs in JSON/prompts use snake_case (`bank_fraud_impersonation`); enums map in `ScenarioOntology` / `ResponseParser`
